# Window Tiler - FVVM Decoration Configuration
# =============================================
#
# LEFT (directional snap):  Up  Down  Left  Right
# RIGHT (window controls):  Close  Minimize  Maximize
#
# FVVM button index mapping used here:
#   1 = Snap Up       (replaces Menu)
#   2 = Snap Down     (replaces Shade)
#   3 = Snap Left     (replaces ?)
#   4 = Snap Right    (replaces ?)
#   6 = Close
#   7 = Minimize      (replaces ?)
#   8 = Maximize/Restore
#
# Note: These override the typical Menu/Shade/etc. behavior.
# The window menu is available via right-click on title bar.

ICONDIR $[HOME]/.fvwm/decorations/icons

# ============================================================
# COLORSETS
# ============================================================

# Active window
Colorset 20 fg #ffffff, bg #2980b9, bgHFocus #1a5276, fgHFocus #ffffff
Colorset 20 fg #ffffff, bg #2980b9
Colorset 21 fg #ffffff, bg #1a5276
Colorset 22 fg #ffffff, bg #c0392b

# Inactive window
Colorset 23 fg #bdc3c7, bg #2c3e50
Colorset 24 fg #ecf0f1, bg #34495e

# ============================================================
# TITLE STYLE
# ============================================================

TitleStyle ActiveColorset 20
TitleStyle ActiveDecorationColorset 20
TitleStyle ActiveButtonColorset 20
TitleStyle InactiveColorset 23
TitleStyle InactiveDecorationColorset 23
TitleStyle InactiveButtonColorset 23

TitleStyle Height 28
TitleStyle Centered
TitleStyle MinimumWidth 80
TitleStyle ActiveFont "xft:Noto Sans:size=10:bold"
TitleStyle InactiveFont "xft:Noto Sans:size=9"
TitleStyle ActiveForeground #ffffff
TitleStyle InactiveForeground #bdc3c7
TitleStyle ActiveBackground #2980b9
TitleStyle InactiveBackground #2c3e50
TitleStyle BorderWidth 2
TitleStyle LeftEdge 2
TitleStyle RightEdge 2
TitleStyle TopEdge 2
TitleStyle BottomEdge 2

# ============================================================
# DECORATION PIXMAPS
# ============================================================

# ---- LEFT SIDE: Directional Snap Buttons ----
# We use button indices 1-4 for directional snaps
# These are custom buttons (not standard FVVM types)

# Button 1 = Snap Up (arrow_up)
Style * Button1Pixmap arrow_up.xpm
Style * Button1LeftPixmap arrow_up.xpm
Style * Button1RightPixmap arrow_up.xpm

# Button 2 = Snap Down (arrow_down)
Style * Button2Pixmap arrow_down.xpm
Style * Button2LeftPixmap arrow_down.xpm
Style * Button2RightPixmap arrow_down.xpm

# Button 3 = Snap Left (arrow_left)
Style * Button3Pixmap arrow_left.xpm
Style * Button3LeftPixmap arrow_left.xpm
Style * Button3RightPixmap arrow_left.xpm

# Button 4 = Snap Right (arrow_right)
Style * Button4Pixmap arrow_right.xpm
Style * Button4LeftPixmap arrow_right.xpm
Style * Button4RightPixmap arrow_right.xpm

# ---- RIGHT SIDE: Window Controls ----

# Close button (red X)
Style * CloseButtonPixmap close.xpm
Style * CloseButtonLeftPixmap close.xpm
Style * CloseButtonRightPixmap close.xpm

# Minimize button (underscore)
Style * IconifyButtonPixmap minimize.xpm
Style * IconifyButtonLeftPixmap minimize.xpm
Style * IconifyButtonRightPixmap minimize.xpm

# Maximize/Restore buttons
Style * MaximizeButtonPixmap maximize.xpm
Style * MaximizeButtonLeftPixmap maximize.xpm
Style * MaximizeButtonRightPixmap maximize.xpm
Style * RestoreButtonPixmap restore.xpm
Style * RestoreButtonLeftPixmap restore.xpm
Style * RestoreButtonRightPixmap restore.xpm

# ============================================================
# BUTTON ORDER IN TITLE BAR
# ============================================================
# Left side: 1(Up) 2(Down) 3(Left) 4(Right)
# Right side: Close, Minimize, Maximize

TitleButtonOrderLeft  1 2 3 4
TitleButtonOrderRight 6 7 8
# 6=Close, 7=Minimize, 8=Maximize (by convention)
# Actually let's use exact standard indices:
# Standard FVVM: 1=Menu, 2=Minimize, 4=Maximize, 6=Close
# We'll reassign:
# Button 1 -> Snap Up (our custom pixmap)
# Button 2 -> Snap Down (our custom pixmap)
# Button 3 -> Snap Left (our custom pixmap)
# Button 4 -> Snap Right (our custom pixmap)
# Button 6 -> Close (standard close)
# For minimize and maximize we need different indices
# In FVVM the "standard" buttons recognized are:
#   1 = Menu
#   2 = Iconify (minimize)
#   4 = Maximize
#   6 = Close
# So we need to arrange: Close(6), Minimize(2), Maximize(4) on right
# and our 4 custom buttons on left using non-standard indices

# Let's redo this properly:
TitleButtonOrderLeft  10 11 12 13
TitleButtonOrderRight 6 2 4

# Buttons 10-13 are custom indices we need to define
